**Better:**
```python
def section(title: str, subtitle: str = None, collapsible: bool = False):
    """Render a consistently-styled section."""
    if collapsible:
        with st.expander(f"{'▶' if collapsed else '▼'} {title}"):
            if subtitle:
                st.caption(subtitle)
            yield
    else:
        st.markdown(f"## {title}")
        if subtitle:
            st.caption(subtitle)
        st.divider()
        yield
```

